XM9 net7 VB3 net9 VDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
S1 Vinp net3 S1 VSS ideal_switch
S2 Vinn net4 S2 VSS ideal_switch
S3 net3 VCM S3 VSS ideal_switch
S4 net4 VCM S4 VSS ideal_switch
S5 net7 net10 S5 VSS ideal_switch
